WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.205 --> 00:00:07.607
A lot's happened in the last ten years.

00:00:07.607 --> 00:00:10.610
It's a miracle I'm even sitting here now.

00:00:10.977 --> 00:00:13.046
I got a second chance

00:00:13.046 --> 00:00:15.181
and I'm going to take advantage of that.

00:00:16.383 --> 00:00:18.218
But I need you with me, Pete.

00:00:19.252 --> 00:00:20.520
We’re going to heal the world.

00:00:32.399 --> 00:00:34.734
Guys, this is my best friend, Harry.

00:00:34.734 --> 00:00:36.803
Hey. Good to meet you.

00:00:36.803 --> 00:00:38.538
New job, huh?

00:00:38.538 --> 00:00:40.874
Still going to have time for tutoring?

00:00:40.874 --> 00:00:41.975
We'll figure it out.

00:00:48.281 --> 00:00:50.917
I didn't know there were bears in these woods.

00:00:51.985 --> 00:00:53.053
Hey, M.J.

00:00:53.053 --> 00:00:54.487
I have another name for you.

00:00:54.487 --> 00:00:55.555
Kraven.

00:00:57.557 --> 00:00:59.459
And he's here on some kind of hunt.

00:01:01.428 --> 00:01:03.730
You know if you need me, I'm just a call away.

00:01:04.631 --> 00:01:05.131
Li.

00:01:05.131 --> 00:01:07.367
You don't know what you took from me.

00:01:08.401 --> 00:01:11.271
All Miles talks about his how to be a better Spider-Man

00:01:11.271 --> 00:01:12.672
How to help you.

00:01:12.739 --> 00:01:14.040
The hell is going on with Pete?

00:01:14.040 --> 00:01:15.375
He's not himself. 

00:01:15.375 --> 00:01:17.477
Go help him

00:01:20.046 --> 00:01:21.514
This was our dream.

00:01:24.451 --> 00:01:26.820
I'm not going to lose you.

00:01:28.621 --> 00:01:32.092
We're going to heal the world.

